  "instructions": [
    "Heat the olive oil in a large saucepan over medium heat.",
    "Add the chopped onion and cook until softened, about 3 minutes.",
    "Add the minced garlic and cook for an additional minute.",
    "Add the rinsed rice and cook for 2 minutes, stirring constantly.",
    "Add the water, vanilla extract, salt, and black pepper, and bring to a boil.",
    "Reduce the heat to low, cover, and simmer for 15 minutes.",
    "Fluff the rice with a fork and stir in the chopped pine nuts.",
    "Serve hot and enjoy."
